This ontology fragment represents the classes and properties related to the HPC domain, including scripts, nodes, resource allocations, job steps, MPI, executable files, local storage, global file systems, hierarchical communications, tools, submitted jobs, running jobs, cancelled jobs, and executed jobs. The properties defined are `CommandLineOption`, which is an object property that relates a script to its command line options.
